# r1115 phase 6, A1 follow-up (same boot as p6_a1.qb): SQ-SLK-01d (SLK-01c block timeline) and "SQ-SY wave 2,
# 2026-11-14" SQ-SY-15 to -21 (scratch_queue.md). Probe syt = tools/soil_yield_probe/sy_probe.js (/syt pot added r1115).
# Superflat: soil replaces the grass at y -61, plant at -60. Soils: farmland, farmersdelight:rich_soil_farmland,
# immersive_weathering:mulch_block (Fertile Soil), farmersdelight:rich_soil, nethersdelight:rich_soul_soil,
# immersive_weathering:nulch_block (Fertile Soul Soil). Ids from p6_a1.qb SQ-SY-ids.
# F3 = Fortune III diamond hoe; melon rolls are the control that the tool string carries Fortune (melons are not
# fortune_free).
pace 1

## SQ-SLK-01d | SLK-01c follow-up: block id every 5 s while an 18-block cow goes to the salt (when does it step, how far)
> forceload add 22090 3994 22150 4006
sleep 3
> kill @e[type=!player,x=22090,y=-62,z=3994,dx=60,dy=8,dz=12]
> fill 22090 -61 3994 22150 -56 4006 minecraft:glass hollow
> pbot spawn c604 22091 -60 3995 minecraft:overworld creative
sleep 2
> zq blocks licked_salt
> setblock 22120 -60 4000 salt:salt_block
> summon minecraft:cow 22138 -60 4000 {NoAI:1b,Tags:["s604"]}
> zhh3 watch minecraft:cow 22120 -60 4000 22 80 20 w4 22120.5,-59.5,4000.5
> execute as @e[tag=s604] run data merge entity @s {NoAI:0b}
repeat 16
sleep 5
> zhh3 block 22120 -60 4000
end
waitlog \[zhh3\] watch w4 done 60
> pbot remove c604
> kill @e[type=minecraft:cow,x=22090,y=-62,z=3994,dx=60,dy=8,dz=12]
> forceload remove 22090 3994 22150 4006
expect \[zhh3\] block 22120 -60 4000 hearthandharvest:lightly_licked_salt_block
look the first non-salt_block line and the order of stages

## SQ-SY-setup | forceload, bot (not a test row)
> forceload add 990 990 1070 1060
sleep 4
> fill 990 -60 990 1070 -55 1060 minecraft:air
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]
> pbot spawn c6s 1000.5 -60 1050.5 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3

